# Para que el repo sea citable (GitHub renderiza esto como "Cite this repository").
# EDITAR: nombre completo y ORCID del autor; DOI de Zenodo cuando exista.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si usas este software, cita este repositorio."
title: "pyintertidal: intertidal topography and distributed tide gauging from the Sentinel-2 archive"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jorge
    family-names: "Alias Alvarez"          # EDITAR si procede (acentos, segundo apellido)
    email: jorge.alias.alvarez@gmail.com
    affiliation: "Universidad de Oviedo"    # EDITAR si procede
repository-code: "https://github.com/coastal-AI/Intertidal_analysis"
license: MIT                                # EDITAR: decidir licencia real
keywords:
  - intertidal topography
  - Sentinel-2
  - tidal transfer
  - estuaries
  - remote sensing
abstract: >-
  Per-pixel inversion of intertidal topography from the Sentinel-2 archive,
  with the interior tide of the estuary estimated from the archive itself
  (binary tide gauging with limb-dependent lags), a calibrated simulator as
  matched null for every claim, sealed predictions, and a validation
  framework that separates method error from point-versus-pixel survey
  sampling error.
